# Guard rail. Nothing under manifests/ is a real credential, and it must stay
# that way — this tree is a scrubbed copy of a live PoC. Reproducing the PoC
# generates the files below locally; none of them may be committed.
sa-signing-key.yaml
oauth_client_secret.json
console-guest-token.txt
pull-secret.json
*kubeconfig
.oidc-client-secret
.session-encryption-key
.session-authentication-key
